cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Se usar o ArcMagery em um trabalho, cite-o assim. / If you use ArcMagery, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ArcMagery: imagens de satélite no ArcMap 10.8 e QGIS, direto no TOC e na resolução nativa"
abstract: >-
  Python Add-In for ArcGIS Desktop 10.8 (ArcMap) and QGIS Plugin that searches, clips and loads satellite imagery into the
  table of contents at native resolution from Google Earth Engine, CBERS/Amazonia-1 (INPE), SPOT 1-5 (CNES,
  co-registered to Esri World Imagery), Google Earth historical imagery, Esri Wayback and XYZ basemaps.
authors:
  - family-names: Gambati
    given-names: Joberth Firmino
version: 2.4.3
date-released: 2026-10-07
license: custom
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yiuky/ArcMagery-releases"
url: "https://github.com/Yiuky/ArcMagery-releases"
keywords:
  - ArcGIS
  - ArcMap
  - QGIS
  - Google Earth Engine
  - CBERS
  - SPOT
  - remote sensing
  - satellite imagery
